# v1.0.3 (S10.3): the drawer stays open in preview (Contents jump, to-do
# toggle, scratch typing; note read-only) and the pointer is DU with one
# GL16 cleanup on hide, on the test notes pack (Forma 1440x1920).
copy-notes tests/test-notes/_test
# Written for the 1.0 layout: run at UI scale 100 % (v1.1 default is 200 %).
ui-scale 100
tap-on Files
tap-on test-headings.md
expect-open _test/test-headings.md
pane Contents
tap-on Preview
expect-mode preview
shot v1.0.3-preview-contents
tap-on Heading:Detail 4.2.a
expect-page 2
expect-mode preview
shot v1.0.3-preview-contents-jump
pane Contents
# To-dos in preview: tapping a box writes the file and re-renders.
tap-on Back
tap-on Files
tap-on test-todos.md
expect-open _test/test-todos.md
pane To-dos
tap-on Preview
expect-mode preview
shot v1.0.3-preview-todos
tap-on TodoBox:Open task one
expect-mode preview
expect-file-contains _test/test-todos.md|- [x] Open task one
shot v1.0.3-preview-todo-toggled
tap-on TodoBox:Open task one
expect-file-contains _test/test-todos.md|- [ ] Open task one
# Scratch stays editable in preview; the note does not change.
pane Scratch
usb plug
tap-on ScratchPane
usb-type in preview
expect-scratch in preview
expect-mode preview
shot v1.0.3-preview-todos-scratch
# A sheet hides the drawer; closing it brings it back.
tap-on Graph
expect-graph map
tap-on Close
# Pointer: moves are DU, hiding runs one GL16 cleanup.
pane To-dos
pane Scratch
tap-on Pencil
pointer plug
pointer-to 700 900
pointer-move 120 40
expect-pointer visible
shot v1.0.3-pointer-du
wait 3200
expect-pointer hidden
shot v1.0.3-pointer-cleaned
# Landscape + Night with the drawer in preview.
tap-on Options
tap-on Dark mode/On
tap-on Orientation/Landscape
tap-on Close
pane Contents
tap-on Preview
shot v1.0.3-preview-landscape-night
tap-on Pencil
pane Contents
tap-on Options
tap-on Dark mode/Off
tap-on Orientation/Portrait
tap-on Close
